"Briefly show the book cover full-screen when opening or closing a book, masking the page-layout flash. "
"Normally requires the book to already be indexed by the cover browser (its cover must have been seen at least once in a grid/list view) "
"— see \"High-Quality Cover\" below to also cover un-indexed books."
