#: screens/sui_menu.lua:2646
msgid ""
"The cover shown right as a book opens normally comes from the library's cached thumbnail, which can look soft on higher-resolution screens. "
"When on, SimpleUI instead reads the cover straight from the book file for that moment (also covers books never opened before, which otherwise show no cover at all) "
"— at the cost of a brief extra pause while opening, since the file has to be read twice. "
"Cover on close is unaffected either way: it already reads the full-quality cover from the open book."
msgstr ""
"书籍打开时显示的封面，一般来自书库的缓存缩略图，在高分辨率屏幕上可能发虚。"
"启用此选项后，插件会直接从书籍文件中读取封面，即便是从未打开过的书也能显示封面（否则将无封面显示）,"
"代价是打开书籍时会多一次短暂停顿，因为文件需要被读取两次。"
"关闭时的封面不受影响：其始终从已打开的书籍中读取完整质量封面。"

